- To stay compliant without using the official mobile app, your viable paths are limited to options explicitly authorized by Frontend Masters (see below).

Practical, compliant alternatives (without the official mobile app)
- Ask for permission: If you have a legitimate need (e.g., extended travel with no internet), contact Frontend Masters support and request a sanctioned offline solution for desktop. If they provide direct, non-DRM links or a temporary method, you can save those files legally.
- Download only permitted materials:
  - Slides, code repositories, and other assets explicitly offered for download by the course or instructor.
  - Any direct, non-DRM file links that the provider explicitly authorizes you to save.
- Use sanctioned enterprise/team options: If your organization has an enterprise arrangement, ask about officially supported offline viewing methods for managed devices that do not rely on the mobile app.

Compliance checklist (before using any tool)
